WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 16 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.760
Whatever you're hiding from me Lyra, I'm going to find out. Let's go.

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:16.690
Thank you, Maron. That was way too close.

3
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.610
But why didn't you tell me the Dragon King was your son?

4
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.530
Hmm, must have slipped my mind. Anyway, Kale's acting strange.

5
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.290
Why does he care so much about who Amber's mother is?

6
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.090
It's not like he's the father.

7
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.090
That's weird, isn't it?

8
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.690
Maybe he's just a psycho control freak. You know, dragons.

9
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.090
Good point.

10
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:39.570
Oh, I just spotted Thaddeus. You've been looking for him all night, haven't you?

11
00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.570
Come on, let me introduce you.

12
00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:50.340
Your Majesty, our ancestors traded our fertility for absolute power,

13
00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.700
leaving the dragon bloodline dangerously thin.

14
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.900
Ellara is the only noble dragon worthy of carrying your heir.

15
00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.900
The throne demands it.

16
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:04.300
Your Majesty, I give myself completely to you.

17
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.820
To bear your heir.

18
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:10.300
I rule. No one decides my heir's mother but me.

19
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:19.140
Out. Now.

20
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:30.300
Your Majesty, I am the only female worthy to stand beside you.

21
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.340
You mean the young lady whose name you repeatedly, explicitly,

22
00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:36.420
and dramatically forbidden from saying your Majesty?

23
00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.900
Apologies, Your Majesty.

24
00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.860
Miss Voss is having a very lively conversation with Mr. Thaddeus' lawn.
